msgid "Estimator V2 example that uses precision in `run()`:\n"
msgstr "Contoh Estimator V2 yang menggunakan precision pada `run()`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler V2 example that uses shots in `run()`:\n"
msgstr "Contoh Sampler V2 yang menggunakan shots pada `run()`:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Output {#output}"
msgstr "Output {#output}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The output is now in the "
"[`PubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult)"
" format. A `PubResult` is the data and metadata resulting from a single "
"PUB’s execution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Output sekarang dalam format "
"[`PubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult)."
" Sebuah `PubResult` adalah data dan metadata yang dihasilkan dari eksekusi "
"satu PUB.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Estimator V2 continues to return expectation values.\n"
msgstr "Estimator V2 tetap mengembalikan nilai ekspektasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `data` portion of a Estimator V2 PubResult contains both expectation "
"values and standard errors (`stds`). V1 returned variance in metadata.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bagian `data` dari PubResult Estimator V2 berisi nilai ekspektasi dan "
"standar error (`stds`). V1 mengembalikan variansi di metadata.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* Sampler V2 returns per-shot measurements in the form of **bitstrings**,\n"
"   instead of the quasi-probability distributions from the V1\n"
"   interface. The bitstrings show the measurement outcomes, preserving the shot\n"
"   order in which they were measured.\n"
"* Sampler V2 has convenience methods like `get_counts()` to help with migration.\n"
"* The Sampler V2 result objects organize data in terms of their **input circuits' classical register names**, for\n"
"   compatibility with dynamic circuits.  By default, the classical register name is `meas`, as shown in the following example.  When defining your circuit, if you create one or more classical registers with a non-default name, use that name to get the results. You can find the classical register name by running `<circuit_name>.cregs`. For example, `qc.cregs`.\n"
msgstr ""
"* Sampler V2 mengembalikan pengukuran per-shot dalam bentuk **bitstring**,\n"
"   alih-alih distribusi kuasi-probabilitas dari antarmuka V1.\n"
"   Bitstring menampilkan hasil pengukuran, mempertahankan\n"
"   urutan shot saat diukur.\n"
"* Sampler V2 memiliki metode bantuan seperti `get_counts()` untuk memudahkan migrasi.\n"
"* Objek hasil Sampler V2 mengorganisasi data berdasarkan **nama register klasikal dari Circuit input**, untuk\n"
"   kompatibilitas dengan dynamic circuit. Secara default, nama register klasikal adalah `meas`, seperti yang ditunjukkan pada contoh berikut. Saat mendefinisikan Circuit-mu, jika kamu membuat satu atau lebih register klasikal dengan nama non-default, gunakan nama itu untuk mendapatkan hasilnya. Kamu bisa menemukan nama register klasikal dengan menjalankan `<circuit_name>.cregs`. Misalnya, `qc.cregs`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"       ```python\n"
"    # Define a quantum circuit with 2 qubits\n"
"    circuit = QuantumCircuit(2)\n"
"    circuit.h(0)\n"
"    circuit.cx(0, 1)\n"
"    circuit.measure_all()\n"
"    circuit.draw()\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"       ```python\n"
"    # Define a quantum circuit with 2 qubits\n"
"    circuit = QuantumCircuit(2)\n"
"    circuit.h(0)\n"
"    circuit.cx(0, 1)\n"
"    circuit.measure_all()\n"
"    circuit.draw()\n"
"    ```\n"

